  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c0dadc5ca18a4ea4a5afb001dad2a95f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CardDungeon::Assets.Scripts.Tutorial.TutorialSO
  FirstRun: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 02238c2f5e7bf674cb347b495fc6ac00, type: 2}
  GuideBuildingKey: sphere-hall
  GearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a980d0c632d67214090fec83f40050c4, type: 2}
  GearLevelIndex: 1
  GearBuildingKey: storehouse
  Lines:
  - Cue: 1
    Text: The dungeon is still waiting. Take The Story to go back down.
  - Cue: 2
    Text: You came home with timber. Click the Hall of Progression's foundation to raise it.
  - Cue: 3
    Text: Build the Hall of Progression. It costs the timber you just brought home.
  - Cue: 4
    Text: The hall stands. Step inside to spend the XP your hero gained.
  - Cue: 5
    Text: The hall stands. Enter it to spend the XP your hero gained.
  - Cue: 6
    Text: Every fight gave your hero XP. Click the glowing node - you can afford it.
  - Cue: 7
    Text: Now press Activate to spend the XP.
  - Cue: 8
    Text: Your hero grew stronger. Head back to town - the road down is open again.
  - Cue: 9
    Text: The town is yours now. When you are ready, take The Story to continue The Threshold.
  - Cue: 10
    Text: Every party falls, and falling is how you get stronger. What you earned on earlier floors is safe - spend it in town, then go back down.
  - Cue: 11
    Text: The floor paid out a sword. Gear is vital to survival down there - open the Storehouse and put it on.
  - Cue: 12
    Text: Enter the Storehouse. Everything you bring home is kept here.
  - Cue: 13
    Text: Pick the Main Hand slot, then the sword, and equip it. A party without gear does not last long.
  - Cue: 14
    Text: Equipped. Check here after every run - better gear turns up the deeper you go. Back to town when ready.
  - Cue: 15
    Text: Your party is armed. When you are ready, take The Story to continue The Threshold.
  - Cue: 16
    Text: Not every open road is meant for you yet. {run} is built for a far stronger party - most go elsewhere first.
  - Cue: 17
    Text: Both heroes earned XP on that floor. Visit the Hall of Progression - the Paladin can grow too.
  - Cue: 18
    Text: The Paladin has XP to spend as well. Spend it on either hero, or go back when you are ready.
